        "created_at": "2013-10-08T13:44:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fanatic's base power is dealing one melee damage and one radiant damage right?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But what I /the guys I play with are not sure of one thing, does this count as one attack or two seperate attacks?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Basically, if you have something that buffs the damage that heroes /attacks do (galvanize/obsidian fields) does Fanatic's base attack do 1+1+1 =3 damage, or does it do 2+2 =4 damage?</p>",
