        "created_at": "2013-10-08T13:47:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Each instance of damage is buffed individually.</p><p>Edit, for clarity: It would be (1 + 1) and (1 + 1). As has been stated in other similar threads, this is *cough* a double-edged sword, as she is easily rendered toothless with a single damage reduction, without other buffs.</p>",
