      {
        "id": 76543,
        "name": "Oaktree",
        "username": "Oaktree",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/{size}/2287_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T23:39:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Necro-ing this thread to ask two questions about Fanatic attacks since searching the forum for specific text does not work well.</p><p>1. If Fanatic is attacking a flipped La Capitan with captured cards does her base power attack only remove one card, or does the two \"packets\" count as separate attacks and thus would remove two cards.</p><p>2. Regarding the damage requirement for retaining Zealous Offense does inflicting 3 points of damage on a target with only 2 HP remaining qualify?&nbsp; Or does the \"damage dealt\" have to be all points that actually reduced HP? (instead of simply having the potential to do so after getting past any DR or other effect out there.)</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:57:09.301Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 8791,
        "topic_slug": "fanatic-question",
        "display_username": "Oaktree",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Necro-ing this thread to ask two questions about Fanatic attacks since searching the forum for specific text does not work well.</p><p>1. If Fanatic is attacking a flipped La Capitan with captured cards does her base power attack only remove one card, or does the two &quot;packets&quot; count as separate attacks and thus would remove two cards.</p><p>2. Regarding the damage requirement for retaining Zealous Offense does inflicting 3 points of damage on a target with only 2 HP remaining qualify?&nbsp; Or does the &quot;damage dealt&quot; have to be all points that actually reduced HP? (instead of simply having the potential to do so after getting past any DR or other effect out there.)</p>",
        "actions_summary": [
