      {
        "id": 76544,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T23:55:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If reduced by DR it will count as the amount of actual damage dealt.&nbsp; However damage dealable is never constrained by HP; you can go into negatives during a Fixed Point or the like, and you'll need to keep track of how low you go, in case you receive some healing which might take you above 0 by the time FP goes away.</p><p>I'm fairly certain that Fanatic's Exorcism should remove two cards.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:57:09.372Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
