        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>If reduced by DR it will count as the amount of actual damage dealt.&nbsp; However damage dealable is never constrained by HP; you can go into negatives during a Fixed Point or the like, and you&#39;ll need to keep track of how low you go, in case you receive some healing which might take you above 0 by the time FP goes away.</p><p>I&#39;m fairly certain that Fanatic&#39;s Exorcism should remove two cards.</p>",
