        "created_at": "2013-12-04T23:58:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;It takes two. &nbsp;Omnitron's Defensive blast can take four. &nbsp;Multi-hits are awesome vs. her.</p><p>2. &nbsp;I counts as 3. &nbsp;You dealt three, none was reduced, so it took three. &nbsp;Negative HP are a real thing. &nbsp;I used to disagree with this, but I was wrong.</p>",
